{"data": [{"author_id": "2009110487250948100", "created_at": "2026-11-07T11:00:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119022059971858474"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/wfyYStOib0", "end": 203, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/koccr8861/status/2119022059971858474/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118675387450634240", "start": 180, "url": "https://t.co/wfyYStOib0"}]}, "id": "2119022059971858474", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 193, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "산업구조분석#1-3 패키징: 칩을 다 찍어도 못 붙여서 못 팔았음, TSMC 넘친 주문은 ASE로 감\n\n지난 편 #1-2에서 AI 칩은 누가 설계하든 TSMC 공장으로 간다고 했음. 그런데 공장에서 칩을 찍었다고 끝이 아님. AI 칩 하나는 계산하는 칩과 HBM(고대역폭 메모리) 여러 개를 한 몸으로 붙여야 완성됨. 이 https://t.co/wfyYStOib0", "url": "https://x.com/koccr8861/status/2119022059971858474"}, {"author_id": "2072257736134590464", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:57:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118930735046504925"], "id": "2118930735046504925", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "If TSMC really moves into HBM, the memory trio should worry less about yield and more about bundling. TSMC already owns CoWoS. Logic + packaging + memory under one roof is a pitch Nvidia and AMD would love. Hype or real threat?", "url": "https://x.com/SYHTheLostSea/status/2118930735046504925"}, {"author_id": "2026683465878720512", "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:08:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118616503364751489", "2118616662727327997"], "id": "2118616503364751489", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GTradX Pulse Report:\n\nAdvanced semiconductor packaging has emerged as the defining bottleneck in artificial intelligence hardware, triggering tens of billions in capital allocation as Nvidia and AMD diversify beyond TSMC’s constrained CoWoS 