ly_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 TSMC ĐANG NẮM GIỮ NÚT THẮT QUAN TRỌNG CỦA CƠN SỐT AI ĐÓNG GÓI CHIP\n\nKhi nhu cầu chip AI tăng mạnh, vấn đề không còn đơn giản là sản xuất được bao nhiêu con chip, mà còn là có đủ năng lực đóng gói chúng hay không.\n\nTSMC hiện giữ vai trò thống trị trong công", "url": "https://x.com/TobyNMT/status/2118903768758768016"}, {"author_id": "268195246", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:43:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118519599457268115"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/fjUbTXzqpT", "end": 206, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jeffjzx/status/2118519599457268115/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118519256229015552", "start": 183, "url": "https://t.co/fjUbTXzqpT"}]}, "id": "2118519599457268115", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 84, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "先進封裝不只 TSMC CoWoS 一條路，英特爾把 EMIB 的成本帳攤開講了。\n\n釜山 ISMP 2026 上，英特爾封裝主管指出：EMIB 用小塊矽橋只接需要互通的位置，晶圓利用率稱超過約 90%；整片矽中介層方案約 60%。路線圖更誇張——今年商用級約 120×120mm、12 組 HBM、20+ 橋；開發中朝 120×180mm、16+ HBM、38+ https://t.co/fjUbTXzqpT", "url": "https://x.com/jeffjzx/status/2118519599457268115"}, {"author_id": "2058302837587685378", "created_at": "2026-11-07T17:47:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119124656557011105"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 4, "start": 0, "tag": "TSM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/rAXEYPGl86", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AuraConvexity/status/2119124656557011105/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119124531319070720", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/rAXEYPGl86"}]}, "id": "2119124656557011105", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 161, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$TSM denied the 3D DRAM rumor today.\n\nTom's Hardware, Nov 7: a TSMC spokesperson said the company \"focuses on our core business at all times, which is dedicated IC foundry\" and will remain the capacity provider \"of the global logic IC industry for years to come.\"\n\nThat answers https://t.co/rAXEYPGl86", "url": "https://x.com/AuraConvexity/status/2119124656557011105"}, {"author_id": "2068356684318179328", "created_at": "2026-11-06T20:49:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118808018183659521"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 12, "start": 7, "tag": "NVDA"}, {"end": 180, "start": 176, "tag": "ASX"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/cFmD4GAuVf", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Bag_Investing/status/2118808018183659521/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118807946553339904", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/cFmD4GAuVf"}]}, "id": "2118808018183659521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 375, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nvidia $NVDA is reportedly providing billions of dollars in financing to expand CoWoS packaging capacity at Siliconware Precision Industries, a unit of Taiwan's ASE Technology $ASX, with the full scale of Nvidia's financial support not previously disclosed.\n\nAdvanced packaging is https://t.co/cFmD4GAuVf", "url": "https://x.com/Bag_Investing/status/2118808018183659521"}, {"author_id": "6611952", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:40:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118850922453319969"], "id": "2118850922453319969", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMCがNVIDIAからの要請を受け、先端メモリーの製造参入を検討していると報じられた。対象はセルを垂直方向へ積層する3D", "url": "https://x.com/got/status/2118850922453319969"}, {"author_id": "258878289", "created_at": "2026-11-06T14:32:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118713101113548840"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 6, "start": 2, "tag": "TSM"}, {"end": 10, "start": 7, "tag": "MU"}, {"end": 16, "start": 11, "tag": "SNDK"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hhTWJHU6F4", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Bearlovesbull/status/2118713101113548840/photo/1"