ry.\nBut another part of the semiconductor supply chain is becoming", "url": "https://x.com/EmmanuelInvest/status/2118589904061948084"}, {"author_id": "1343459213004173312", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:48:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118702077920850333"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/LwvQL3ieUz", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SergeyCYW/status/2118702077920850333/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118702072908664832", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/LwvQL3ieUz"}]}, "id": "2118702077920850333", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1461, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Semiconductor Stocks Have Fallen Sharply From ATH, Despite Explosive Growth Forecasts. Buying Opportunity or Valuation Trap?\n\nSentiment toward semiconductor stocks has turned sharply negative. Despite strong AI demand, shares of major industry leaders have declined significantly https://t.co/LwvQL3ieUz", "url": "https://x.com/SergeyCYW/status/2118702077920850333"}, {"author_id": "2095722313744601088", "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:11:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118858732314783842"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/77M6EdLRja", "end": 168, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rennix7t/status/2118858732314783842/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118858719262052352", "start": 145, "url": "https://t.co/77M6EdLRja"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/77M6EdLRja", "end": 168, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rennix7t/status/2118858732314783842/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118858723280195584", "start": 145, "url": "https://t.co/77M6EdLRja"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/77M6EdLRja", "end": 168, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rennix7t/status/2118858732314783842/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118858727025721344", "start": 145, "url": "https://t.co/77M6EdLRja"}]}, "id": "2118858732314783842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 156, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count"